    "result_text": "The full test suite is green. \n\n## Summary\n\nThe `selfLink` field needed to appear on the owner response DTO. Two changes:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a `selfLink` string property to the `OwnerDto` schema (read-only), so the generated DTO gains the field.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a MapStruct `@Mapping` that populates it:\n   ```java\n   @Mapping(target = \"selfLink\",\n       expression = \"java(owner.getId() == null ? null : \\\"/api/owners/\\\" + owner.getId())\")\n   ```\n\nSince `RespondWithOwner` (GET) and `RespondWithOwnerCreated` (POST) both send `ownerMapper.toOwnerDto(owner)`, the link is now returned on every owner response. The new acceptance test `coreReturnsSelfLink` passes, and `./mvnw -o test` reports `BUILD SUCCESS` with no failures.",
